		<revisionDesc>
			<change when="2025-02-25">Added: @xml:lang on note; @xml:id on cell, item, l, lg,
				p, row and seg; @n on metamark; @function=transp on metamark, listTranspose
				and transpose. Modified @rend values on byline and dateline.</change>
			<change when="2025-02-05">Added support for msDesc and child elements.</change>
			<change when="2025-02-04">Support TEI <ref target="https://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/readme-4.9.0.html">P5 version 4.9.0</ref>.</change>
